        "Body": {
          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<p><span>Microsoft announces the opening of its cloud region in\nDenmark to accelerate digital transformation and AI innovation. The Denmark\nEast region provides Danish customers with local, secure cloud infrastructure,\nsupporting local data residency, low latency, an access to advanced cloud and\nAI services.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>For customers looking to leverage\nthe new region and Availability Zones, Azure offers region portability for\nmultiple resources with</span><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fservices%2Fresource-mover%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7CDevon.Allen%40microsoft.com%7Cfdfd7f4498d54ef445c708db4506019a%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638179664324681098%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IjAeIwOmgRJ78NK8PPAcJHC%2BAk49Q8VEU9TjfJQWyow%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>&nbsp;</span></a><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/resource-mover/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Azure\nResource Mover</span></a><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fservices%2Fresource-mover%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7CDevon.Allen%40microsoft.com%7Cfdfd7f4498d54ef445c708db4506019a%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638179664324681098%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IjAeIwOmgRJ78NK8PPAcJHC%2BAk49Q8VEU9TjfJQWyow%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>.</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/DenmarkLaunch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Learn more</span></a><a href=\"https://datacenters.microsoft.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>.</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
          "Markdown": "Microsoft announces the opening of its cloud region in\n\nDenmark to accelerate digital transformation and AI innovation. The Denmark\n\nEast region provides Danish customers with local, secure cloud infrastructure,\n\nsupporting local data residency, low latency, an access to advanced cloud and\n\nAI services.\n\nFor customers looking to leverage\n\nthe new region and Availability Zones, Azure offers region portability for\n\nmultiple resources with Azure\n\nResource Mover .\n\nLearn more ."
        },
